# =============================================================================
# Run manifest: FLAGSHIP 4-brain — v2 CORPUS arm, 30k  (tanitad-pod / RTX A6000)
# Installed 2026-07-25, ~25 min after launch, onto a LIVE run (pid 699286).
#
# TRAIN_CMD args are copied VERBATIM from the live process (/proc/699286/cmdline)
# so a resume reproduces the running recipe exactly. The trainer auto-resumes
# from OUT/ckpt.pt (written every 1,000 steps ~= every 3.2 h).
# PYTHONPATH is REQUIRED (else ModuleNotFoundError: tanitad).
#
# WHY THIS IS SAFE TO INSTALL WHILE THE RUN IS ALIVE: TRAIN_MATCH is the
# anti-double-launch guard. supervise_run.sh sees the already-running trainer,
# logs "trainer ALREADY RUNNING outside this supervisor - NOT launching", and
# only takes over once it is gone. That makes this a DEATH-ONLY watchdog: it
# never touches a healthy run, and never fights it for the GPU or ckpt.pt.
#
# The pattern is deliberately narrow (script name AND this run's out-dir) so it
# can never be satisfied by a different flagship run.
#
# NOTE (v2 provenance gap): under --v2-cache the trainer does NOT record the
# corpus path in OUT/config.json ("cache_dirs": null, "data": "realmix"). The
# corpus identity for this arm therefore lives HERE and in the launch log:
#   corpus  physicalai-v2bal-4b7eeeac222d  (9,000 clips / 49.742 h)
#   key     4b7eeeac222d  (recomputed from the built clip-ids at promotion)
# =============================================================================
RUN_ID="flagship-v2corpus-30k"
WORKDIR="/workspace/TanitAD/stack"
OUT="/workspace/experiments/flagship-v2corpus-30k"
DONE_TOKEN="FLAGSHIP4B_DONE"
ENABLED="1"
TRAIN_MATCH='train_flagship4b\.py.*flagship-v2corpus-30k'

TRAIN_CMD='export PYTHONPATH=/workspace/TanitAD/stack; export PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True; exec python3 -u scripts/train_flagship4b.py --v2-cache /workspace/data/physicalai_v2/epcache-physicalai-v2bal-4b7eeeac222d --config flagship4b --v2 --sigreg-free-dims 64 --steps 30000 --batch-size 16 --accum 4 --grad-checkpoint --lr 3e-4 --warmup 2000 --workers 8 --v2-lru 64 --guard-limit-gb 45 --ckpt-every 1000 --log-every 50 --out /workspace/experiments/flagship-v2corpus-30k'
